  "goodToKnow": "Der Reigen is a round dance in a circle, and figuratively a series or succession: den Reigen eröffnen (to lead off), ein bunter Reigen von Veranstaltungen. Arthur Schnitzler's play Reigen (written 1897) links ten couples in a chain of encounters; its 1920 Berlin premiere caused a scandal and a trial. The plural is the same: die Reigen."
